    <briefdescription>
<para>Ordered collection of field-level changes between two project states. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1projects_1_1_delta_set" kindref="compound">DeltaSet</ref> is the canonical result type of all diff operations and the input to merge operations. It is always structured (typed field-level deltas), never a raw text diff. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
